WEBVTT

00:00.430 --> 00:10.690
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.430 --> 00:10.690
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:19.080 --> 00:25.460
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:19.080 --> 00:25.460
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.460 --> 00:29.670
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.460 --> 00:29.670
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.260 --> 00:39.140
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.260 --> 00:39.140
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:39.140 --> 00:44.980
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:39.140 --> 00:44.980
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:45.060 --> 00:51.780
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:45.060 --> 00:51.780
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:52.150 --> 00:57.950
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:52.150 --> 00:57.950
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.320 --> 01:06.540
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.320 --> 01:06.540
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.540 --> 01:12.710
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.540 --> 01:12.710
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.260 --> 01:16.590
doko made yukeru

01:13.260 --> 01:16.590
and go anywhere,

01:16.590 --> 01:24.810
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.590 --> 01:24.810
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:42.330 --> 01:46.500
Ritsuka, did anything different
happened this past week?

01:51.630 --> 01:53.210
Different?

01:56.470 --> 01:57.470
Not really...

01:59.840 --> 02:04.390
I haven't seen him for a week.

02:08.190 --> 02:11.810
Even though he said he loved me...

02:15.860 --> 02:17.240
Ritsuka Aoyagi?

02:17.240 --> 02:18.610
The new guy...

02:18.610 --> 02:20.950
He came while you were absent.

02:23.490 --> 02:24.830
Not interested.

02:24.830 --> 02:29.750
But that Aoyagi is getting
along really well with Hawatari.

02:29.750 --> 02:30.460
What?

02:30.460 --> 02:31.880
Good morning!

02:32.290 --> 02:35.590
Ritsuka, you're so handsome today too!

02:35.880 --> 02:39.010
What? Yuiko held his hand?

02:39.010 --> 02:43.010
In any case, did you read
the book I lent you yesterday?

02:43.010 --> 02:44.760
Yes, I read it!

02:45.010 --> 02:49.770
M-Moreover, Yuiko read a book!

02:50.600 --> 02:52.190
Ritsuka Aoyagi...

02:53.270 --> 02:56.900
He is pretty, like a girl...

02:56.900 --> 02:58.240
B-But...

02:58.240 --> 03:00.450
...he's short!

03:01.240 --> 03:02.820
Y-Yayoi?

03:03.780 --> 03:05.990
Short? Me?

03:05.990 --> 03:07.700
Yes! Ritsuka Aoyagi!

03:07.700 --> 03:11.370
You are shorter than Yuiko!

03:13.500 --> 03:15.210
So are you.

03:16.840 --> 03:19.470
In this instance, my
height has no relevance...

03:20.010 --> 03:22.550
The problem is you!

03:23.050 --> 03:26.390
Short people are not
qualified to go out with Yuiko!

03:26.760 --> 03:30.560
We're not going out. We're just friends.

03:30.560 --> 03:31.350
Right?

03:38.690 --> 03:42.200
No way...

03:42.610 --> 03:44.620
Yuiko, don't tell me!

03:47.450 --> 03:48.120
Yuiko...

03:50.040 --> 03:52.000
Please go out with me!

03:52.250 --> 03:56.710
Can't, can't, can't, can't, Yuiko can't!

03:58.250 --> 04:01.010
S-She said "can't" five times...

04:04.760 --> 04:05.300
Yuiko...

04:06.390 --> 04:08.260
...can't go out with someone
who's shorter than me.

04:10.270 --> 04:10.680
So...

04:11.060 --> 04:12.390
I'm sorry!

04:20.070 --> 04:24.320
So that was just an
excuse to reject me, right Yuiko?

04:25.570 --> 04:26.450
Let's go.

04:26.820 --> 04:28.200
O-Okay.

04:30.870 --> 04:32.160
"Let's go"?

04:33.410 --> 04:35.540
Hey, you okay?

04:39.800 --> 04:43.510
Look's like it's gonna rain...

04:47.890 --> 04:48.930
Seimei...

04:51.970 --> 04:55.100
You were so tall...

04:57.650 --> 05:03.900
I'm sure I will grow tall, like Seimei.

05:09.080 --> 05:09.950
Ritsuka!

05:11.490 --> 05:12.870
He's here to see you!

05:18.420 --> 05:19.170
Soubi!

05:19.590 --> 05:22.170
Oh, Aoyagi's brother?

05:22.170 --> 05:22.840
No!

05:24.170 --> 05:25.760
Um, I mean...

05:26.470 --> 05:27.720
He's not...

05:29.180 --> 05:30.930
My brother died.

05:31.970 --> 05:33.390
Oh, sorry, I...

05:33.390 --> 05:38.310
That guy, Soubi Agatsuma
is my brother's friend, and...

05:38.940 --> 05:41.360
...he hangs out with me sometimes.

05:43.530 --> 05:45.070
I see...

05:46.530 --> 05:50.320
He has no ears anymore.

05:54.700 --> 05:59.670
P-Please tell him not to smoke
in front of the elementary school.

06:01.960 --> 06:05.720
And also about tomorrow's
parent-teacher open house...

06:05.720 --> 06:10.010
Ritsuka, I'll go ahead
and wait with him!

06:10.390 --> 06:14.680
Listen, Aoyagi, you're
new to this school, and...

06:14.680 --> 06:18.270
...I want either your
mom or dad to come.

06:21.270 --> 06:22.190
Well...

06:22.400 --> 06:25.480
You did give them the
invitation letter, right?

06:36.700 --> 06:40.420
I've never seen such a sad face before...

06:41.080 --> 06:45.420
He seems mature, but he is
only a sixth grader after all...

06:58.810 --> 07:00.600
You dummy, Ritsuka.

07:01.350 --> 07:03.610
When Mother becomes like that...

07:06.150 --> 07:07.860
...I told you to run away.

07:08.780 --> 07:11.160
Run away to me.

07:13.280 --> 07:20.290
Seimei, I have no place
to run away to anymore.

07:30.300 --> 07:30.880
Soubi!

07:33.090 --> 07:35.180
Don't smoke in front of the school!

07:38.100 --> 07:39.640
What were you doing?

07:39.640 --> 07:42.230
You left me alone for a week!

07:42.650 --> 07:43.650
You missed me?

07:43.650 --> 07:44.480
No!

07:44.650 --> 07:46.480
You...

07:46.480 --> 07:47.320
You love me?

07:48.570 --> 07:49.860
Of course not!

07:50.570 --> 07:52.820
Ritsuka, what's wrong?

07:52.820 --> 07:54.370
You're a little scary.

07:54.990 --> 07:56.580
Uh, nothing...

07:57.080 --> 08:00.200
Soubi was busy with his assignment.

08:01.500 --> 08:02.160
Assignment?

08:02.540 --> 08:05.330
Yes, I'm a college student.

08:05.880 --> 08:07.250
College student?

08:07.750 --> 08:08.630
Soubi?

08:09.670 --> 08:13.470
Wow, you're cool, hanging
out with a college student!

08:14.640 --> 08:16.100
It's not that we're hanging out...

08:16.350 --> 08:17.890
We're not hanging out.

08:18.680 --> 08:21.560
Ritsuka and I are a master and servant.

08:22.980 --> 08:24.810
Mustard sandwich?

08:25.150 --> 08:26.480
Ritsuka is the master...

08:26.860 --> 08:28.440
...and I am the one who serves him.

08:29.860 --> 08:32.530
That's why I came to be connected with him.

08:34.030 --> 08:35.070
Is this...

08:35.070 --> 08:37.370
Whoa, pretty backdrop!

08:44.080 --> 08:47.500
Speed dial 1 has my number in it.

08:48.210 --> 08:49.170
Call me anytime.

08:50.380 --> 08:51.530
No, I won't

08:51.530 --> 08:52.880
Huh, why?

08:53.130 --> 08:54.180
Ring me...

08:55.050 --> 08:56.640
You can message me as well.

09:04.060 --> 09:07.770
Only the calls from me will blink
red, so you'll know right away.

09:08.150 --> 09:11.070
I can't accept this out of nowhere.

09:12.150 --> 09:16.780
I don't want Ritsuka to
feel lonely or worried...

09:16.780 --> 09:19.030
You can contact me through this.

09:20.660 --> 09:23.410
I-I'm not lonely...

09:26.540 --> 09:27.670
Kio...

09:29.000 --> 09:29.840
I'll return soon.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.590
I'm a little busy right now.

09:32.710 --> 09:35.340
Hey Soubi! Are you listening?

09:36.510 --> 09:39.300
That guy hung up on me!

09:39.430 --> 09:42.600
I know! Why don't we go to my place?

09:42.600 --> 09:46.980
Nobody's at home today, so come on!

09:48.270 --> 09:49.610
Nobody's home?

09:49.860 --> 09:51.730
Soubi, will you come too?

09:53.820 --> 09:55.030
If Ritsuka's going.

09:55.280 --> 09:57.030
Then it's decided! Let's go!

09:57.030 --> 09:57.530
H-Hey!

09:58.070 --> 10:00.370
I didn't say I was going!

10:01.280 --> 10:02.990
I want to...

10:04.200 --> 10:07.410
Oh, Y-Yuiko!

10:08.540 --> 10:11.880
Soubi, what are you studying in college?

10:11.880 --> 10:13.880
Paintings. Japanese paintings.

10:13.880 --> 10:16.300
Japanese paintings? That's great!

10:16.300 --> 10:17.260
Great?

10:17.470 --> 10:19.760
Normally, people can't paint.

10:20.140 --> 10:23.180
Then next time, I'll
paint something for you, Ritsuka.

10:24.270 --> 10:24.930
What?

10:25.140 --> 10:26.100
Voila!

10:26.100 --> 10:28.810
Chicken soboro and burdock pasta.

10:28.980 --> 10:30.560
Ooh, smells good!

10:30.560 --> 10:31.650
Let's eat!

10:32.820 --> 10:36.070
You should eat good food and train
your tongue's ability to taste.

10:36.690 --> 10:38.860
Why do I have to train my tongue?

10:39.570 --> 10:43.280
Sharpening your senses will
get you ready for battle.

10:43.530 --> 10:44.580
Battle?

10:45.200 --> 10:46.200
What kind of battle?

10:50.080 --> 10:52.960
The kind that uses your tongue...

10:52.960 --> 10:54.920
Sometimes you bite,
sometimes you get bitten...

10:55.170 --> 10:56.800
What are you talking about?

10:56.800 --> 10:59.010
Who bites their tongue? That's sick!

11:00.510 --> 11:01.970
It might feel good.

11:06.140 --> 11:08.770
Ritsuka, use the umbrella.

11:08.770 --> 11:10.390
Well, see you tomorrow!

11:21.360 --> 11:23.160
Ring me anytime.

11:23.780 --> 11:25.830
I'll always answer.

11:25.830 --> 11:27.160
Always?

11:27.160 --> 11:29.120
Yes, always.

11:30.790 --> 11:33.170
You always answer the phone?

11:33.670 --> 11:35.000
Don't say you can when you can't!

11:35.630 --> 11:36.840
I can.

11:38.090 --> 11:39.920
If Ritsuka's calling,
I will surely answer.

11:43.010 --> 11:45.180
I live for Ritsuka...

11:46.260 --> 11:48.390
There is nothing I can't do.

11:48.430 --> 11:49.810
Enough!

11:50.560 --> 11:52.380
I'm going home by myself!

11:52.380 --> 11:53.650
I'll walk with you.

11:58.320 --> 11:59.360
Ritsuka...

12:00.490 --> 12:03.710
Your slim back is so cute.

12:04.570 --> 12:06.330
But sorry...

12:06.330 --> 12:08.830
Let's begin training

12:13.580 --> 12:16.710
Soubi! Who's this brat?

12:17.040 --> 12:18.670
You have me!

12:19.000 --> 12:23.970
Kio, don't look through
people's bags without consent...

12:24.720 --> 12:26.970
So, who is he?

12:29.850 --> 12:32.690
His name is Ritsuka Aoyagi, I
can't say any more than that.

12:33.230 --> 12:34.730
Aoyagi?

12:34.730 --> 12:36.560
Is he related to Seimei?

12:37.060 --> 12:38.480
Don't tell me it's his kid?

12:38.770 --> 12:40.400
Not possible.

12:40.400 --> 12:42.280
Seimei had his ears.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.320
It's his younger brother.

12:44.910 --> 12:47.740
Oh, no way!

12:48.450 --> 12:51.370
Soubi, you're going to
serve under an Aoyagi again?

12:51.950 --> 12:56.500
If you want to be tortured, I'll do it for
you until you won't be able to stand up.

12:57.290 --> 12:59.960
Kio, I'm not a pervert.

13:00.210 --> 13:01.760
You're lying!

13:01.760 --> 13:04.550
You pierced again.

13:04.800 --> 13:06.220
You noticed?

13:06.220 --> 13:07.550
Interested?

13:07.550 --> 13:09.470
I can punch one for you!

13:13.980 --> 13:21.190
Seimei, I was afraid of altars
before, but I think they're beautiful now.

13:23.280 --> 13:27.160
The snow-white chrysanthemums
and the candlelight...

13:28.870 --> 13:30.330
They're all beautiful.

13:46.340 --> 13:47.930
I know...

13:47.930 --> 13:52.140
For Mom, I'm not the same
Ritsuka as of two years ago...

13:52.720 --> 13:56.100
She's not going to come to school!

14:04.900 --> 14:06.240
I want to see him?

14:15.160 --> 14:16.580
No, I don't want to see him...

14:17.410 --> 14:20.380
It hurts when I see him.

14:21.880 --> 14:23.420
Seimei...

14:24.050 --> 14:29.090
You always talked to me
so that I understood, but...

14:31.140 --> 14:32.430
He...

14:33.430 --> 14:35.680
He lies all the time.

14:38.730 --> 14:40.230
Looking at it won't call.

14:45.280 --> 14:47.490
If you want to hear my voice,
you should just call me.

14:47.490 --> 14:48.740
I don't!

14:51.070 --> 14:53.200
Why do you always come from the window!

14:53.200 --> 14:54.160
It's not an entrance!

14:55.200 --> 14:56.620
I have a favor to ask you.

14:56.620 --> 14:58.750
What is it? Just dry yourself off

14:58.750 --> 14:59.540
Ritsuka...

15:00.540 --> 15:01.500
I want you to pierce it.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.500
Isn't it a pretty ear?

15:05.500 --> 15:10.130
I want you to drive the
needle in and make me yours.

15:12.970 --> 15:14.300
Here, the piercer.

15:15.930 --> 15:17.140
Me?

15:17.140 --> 15:20.060
No, I can't do it!

15:20.060 --> 15:21.270
Please.

15:21.690 --> 15:23.020
Don't be ridiculous!

15:23.020 --> 15:24.310
Won't that hurt?

15:24.310 --> 15:25.610
Why are you making me do this?

15:27.190 --> 15:30.240
The pain will become the
proof that bond between us.

15:31.110 --> 15:31.950
The pain?

15:33.820 --> 15:36.080
The mark will never go away.

15:36.660 --> 15:39.330
Every time I look at it,
I'll think of Ritsuka.

15:40.500 --> 15:41.420
It's a memory...

15:42.250 --> 15:43.540
Memory.

15:44.420 --> 15:49.380
If you do it, I'll do whatever you like.

15:49.380 --> 15:50.630
Anything?

15:50.970 --> 15:53.890
Yes, anything.

15:57.390 --> 16:00.350
Soubi, it's soft.

16:02.770 --> 16:05.810
Yes, right there.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.650
Here?

16:07.980 --> 16:08.730
Do it.

16:15.370 --> 16:17.240
I can't do it!

16:19.120 --> 16:20.790
Show me your willpower...

16:20.790 --> 16:24.420
If it doesn't pierce all
the way, it'll hurt more.

16:26.840 --> 16:29.880
Is that so, if that's how it is, then fine...

16:44.020 --> 16:47.190
How was it? Does it hurt?

16:47.190 --> 16:48.320
I'm fine.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.230
Continue.

16:51.990 --> 16:53.200
O-Okay...

17:02.790 --> 17:04.080
Is there pain?

17:04.710 --> 17:08.340
It tingles a little, but I'm happy.

17:12.800 --> 17:14.880
Thank you, Ritsuka.

17:23.480 --> 17:28.060
So, will you do what I say?

17:28.560 --> 17:29.400
Of course.

17:30.520 --> 17:36.610
Soubi, tell me everything
you know about Septimal Moon.

17:38.370 --> 17:39.450
Hey!

17:39.830 --> 17:41.120
I can't...

17:41.120 --> 17:44.160
I can't say anything about that topic...

17:44.750 --> 17:46.080
It's forbidden.

17:47.580 --> 17:51.250
Did Seimei command you to not tell me?

17:52.300 --> 17:53.590
I can't answer that.

17:54.510 --> 17:57.220
If you don't like it, punish me.

17:57.340 --> 17:58.550
Tell me!

17:58.550 --> 18:01.180
You said you will do
whatever I ask you to!

18:04.060 --> 18:05.230
Go away!

18:05.230 --> 18:07.140
I don't want to see your face!

18:07.140 --> 18:07.600
Go away!

18:13.730 --> 18:16.530
Tomorrow is the parent-teacher open house,
isn't it?

18:17.450 --> 18:18.990
I talked with Yuiko.

18:20.120 --> 18:22.080
I also saw the paper on your desk.

18:23.790 --> 18:24.950
Should I go instead?

18:25.620 --> 18:28.330
Command me to come to the open house.

18:28.500 --> 18:29.920
Stop joking around!

18:29.920 --> 18:31.130
Just go away!

18:32.170 --> 18:32.670
Ritsuka.

18:32.670 --> 18:33.740
Don't say my name!

18:33.740 --> 18:35.010
I don't want to see you!

18:35.010 --> 18:37.630
I don't like thinking
about you all the time!

18:38.470 --> 18:40.590
You're thinking about me all the time?

18:40.760 --> 18:42.140
Shut up!

18:42.140 --> 18:44.010
I get so tired...

18:44.010 --> 18:47.060
I'm commanding you!
Don't come to the open house!

18:47.640 --> 18:48.810
I understand...

18:48.810 --> 18:50.690
I love you, Ritsuka.

18:53.270 --> 18:56.740
He's so selfish.

18:56.740 --> 19:02.240
Why does he confuse me
every time I see him?

19:10.460 --> 19:14.500
Seimei told me to go to Ritsuka, but...

19:19.510 --> 19:23.350
I never thought

19:19.510 --> 19:23.350
I would grow to love him this much...

19:23.760 --> 19:30.310
Parents and guardians,
thank you for taking the time to come.

19:30.520 --> 19:33.270
Thank you!

19:36.440 --> 19:40.110
As I thought, neither mom nor dad
came...

19:41.110 --> 19:42.780
...and of course Soubi.

19:42.780 --> 19:43.990
Ritsuka!

19:44.660 --> 19:46.450
Tomorrow's Sunday.

19:46.450 --> 19:47.910
Let's go somewhere!

19:47.910 --> 19:48.790
Huh?

19:48.790 --> 19:50.210
Don't say "huh"!

19:51.120 --> 19:52.580
Can I go, too?

19:53.630 --> 19:55.750
You guys are just friends, right?

19:56.210 --> 19:58.300
I am also Yuiko's friend.

19:58.840 --> 20:01.720
And besides, I want to
know more about Aoyagi.

20:02.760 --> 20:03.550
Me?

20:05.640 --> 20:09.680
Well, then do you want to
create memories with us?

20:09.980 --> 20:11.020
Memories?

20:11.560 --> 20:13.400
Well, yeah...

20:14.400 --> 20:17.520
Fine, let's make memories.

20:17.820 --> 20:21.900
Okay, we'll take lunch,
and go to the park...

20:21.900 --> 20:22.530
Oh, it's blinking...

20:29.490 --> 20:31.200
Sorry, I'll call you later!

20:32.250 --> 20:34.210
H-Huh?

20:34.210 --> 20:35.750
Later!

20:37.460 --> 20:39.210
I don't want to see him...

20:40.880 --> 20:43.180
I don't want to...

20:47.850 --> 20:50.100
Soubi! Why are you here?

20:50.930 --> 20:53.350
I was told not to come
to the open house, but...

20:54.140 --> 20:56.100
...I wasn't told not to
come to pick you up.

20:56.270 --> 20:57.900
W-Well...

20:58.730 --> 21:01.360
I wasn't told not to
love Ritsuka, either.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.150
Let's go!

21:19.090 --> 21:22.050
I want us to take pictures again.

21:23.300 --> 21:24.130
Sure...

21:25.090 --> 21:28.530
Let's take a lot of memories of us.

21:27.010 --> 21:31.970
To be continued...

21:29.810 --> 21:39.360
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:29.810 --> 21:39.360
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:40.150 --> 21:49.660
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:40.150 --> 21:49.660
we still can't be one.

21:50.240 --> 22:00.170
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:50.240 --> 22:00.170
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:00.590 --> 22:08.180
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:00.590 --> 22:08.180
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:10.720 --> 22:15.560
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:10.720 --> 22:15.560
We no longer dream anymore,

22:15.560 --> 22:20.690
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:15.560 --> 22:20.690
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:20.980 --> 22:29.910
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:20.980 --> 22:29.910
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:31.030 --> 22:41.040
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:31.030 --> 22:41.040
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:41.380 --> 22:50.260
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:41.380 --> 22:50.260
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:50.640 --> 22:55.770
Ima mo kitto

22:50.640 --> 22:55.770
Surely, even now...

23:00.400 --> 23:03.020
Listen, Soubi! I got
a new part-time job.

23:03.020 --> 23:07.650
I take off all my clothes in front of
a lot of people, and do crazy poses.

23:07.650 --> 23:08.740
Interested?

23:08.740 --> 23:10.660
Yes, of course.

23:11.070 --> 23:13.780
That part-time job is being a model
for figure drawing class, right?

23:14.330 --> 23:17.120
If it's Kio's body, I'd like to draw it.

23:17.120 --> 23:19.000
Aw, Soubi!

23:19.540 --> 23:22.170
Tale four, Friendless.

23:22.170 --> 23:23.880
I'll take my clothes
off for you anytime!
